# Regenerated local state, not config. cache/ and .cache/ hold rendered
# widget snapshots, server-action caches, and agent-turn/ACP session data
# (actual coding-agent transcript content) that must never land in this
# PUBLIC repo. baby-menu.db is app-local sqlite state, currently empty with
# no schema. Mirrors home/.config/nvim/.gitignore's precedent for keeping
# generated content out of an otherwise-tracked symlinked directory.
cache/
.cache/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Baby Menu-owned seed files. On every launch Baby Menu copies its bundled
# Contents/Resources/extensions-template/ over ~/.baby-menu/extensions/ with
# a forced recursive copy (seedExtensionWorkspace in the app's main process),
# so any tracked copy is overwritten with whatever the installed version
# ships and re-dirties this repo at each login. The app re-seeds them on
# every machine, so nothing is lost by not tracking them. Keep widget
# changes in the per-extension sources (e.g. claude-code-quota/server.ts),
# never in these files. If a Baby Menu upgrade adds a new template path, it
# will show up as untracked: add it here rather than committing it.
extensions/AGENTS.md
extensions/babymenu-env.d.ts
extensions/hello-world/
extensions/recipes/
